    <string name="disclaimer_title">Important</string>
    <string name="disclaimer_body">This app cannot unlock THIS phone from inside Android — a phone cannot send bootloader commands to itself. Unlocking always needs a separate host. If you have a second phone and a USB-OTG cable, use \"Fastboot over OTG\" to unlock or flash the other phone with no PC. This app also detects your status and guides you.</string>

